00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.510 align:start position:0%
 
what's going on guys today we're going  to be theorizing what it would be like  if there were ten titan shifters in the  world of attack on titan  for most of this series the amount of  titans was a complete mystery and it  wasn't until the end of season three  that we got confirmation there were nine  of them in total  my personal theory as to why isaiah  didn't make more is because the way the  story was set up by the time they  reached the basement  we already knew the parodies didn't have  more shifters so if there were going to  be 10 11 or even 12 of these things  by default the rest would have all been  malian warriors doing that would have  made mali way too overpowered especially  during the battle in liberio  so it was a good decision by isayama to  not make things even more difficult for  the scouts  that being said though it's still fun to  think about what features a 10-shifter  might have had and in this video i'll be  doing exactly that by discussing a titan  that i think would have been a realistic  addition to the series  the main idea behind this one is that it  has a special connection to the  coordinate that gives it certain  abilities  and as the title suggests its name would  be the past titan  after the video is done let me know in  the comments how you think it ranks  compared to the others  and don't forget to hit that sub button  if you want to see more videos like this  okay so starting with a brief  description of what paws are in the  first place  they are the abstract force that  connects the coordinate to every elegant  on the planet  and in the past dimension this force is  represented by branches of light  all subjects of emir are born with their  own path that links them to the founding  titan  hence why historically the founder has  been able to mess with aliens in so many  ways  including wiping their memories or  sending the flesh and bones that would  turn them into a titan  besides this very few shifters can  interfere with pars or the past  dimension  so if a 10th one existed that is pretty  much exactly what it would do  standing at 50 meters tall i imagine the  past item would be mostly covered in a  thin protective shell of hardening  with its most distinctive feature being  its mask this mask would remain in place  most of the time unless the shifter was  about to scream  at which point it can be detached  similar to how rhino can selectively  unharden parts of the armored titan  over the years we've seen that screaming  can be used for different purposes and  for the past titan it would have two  screams that would be its most important  abilities  its first screen would literally be able  to interrupt other people's titan  transformations  meaning their titles will end up being  incomplete or the victim would just  remain in their human form  aaron once mentioned how the flesh of a  titan is sent via pods  well this shifter screen can block that  signal and make it so the titan body  never reaches the destination in this  way the paths can prevent both shifters  and pure titans from manifesting  but the scream has to occur before they  completely transform  if we use an easy example to see how  this could work in practice let's  imagine the user of the past titan was  with these guys during the declaration  of war  in that scenario it would not have been  able to stop aaron's first  transformation  since he didn't know it was about to  happen and if it did scream it likely  would have been way too late  what it could do though is prevent aaron  from transforming a second or third time  which is what he did in the main series  and by doing this the attack titan would  at best only partially manifest  a royal blooded founder is the only  shifter who would be unaffected by this  ability  but for everyone else including royals  like zeke there's nothing they can do to  get around this  moving on to the past titan's second  scream this one would be a twist on the  ability to create pure  titans as it has a big benefit but also  a big cost at the same time  the benefit is that any ld within range  of the scream can be turned into a pure  titan  without the need to first consume spinal  fluid if we look at the main series  whenever z wanted to make pure titans he  needed to make sure they first ingested  his spinal fluid in some form  because that fluid is what connected  them to the beast titan when it comes to  the past titan though  it doesn't have to do this because it  has a special connection to the  coordinate  which by proxy implies it has a faint  connection to every elden as well  ultimately what that means is that  aliens within range of the scream will  be turned into mindless titans with  acumens and other shifters being the  only ones who are naturally immune  the pure titans that are created can  then be controlled depending on if the  user of the past titan has royal blood  and this is where we come to the  downsides if a person without real blood  has the shifter  their number one the titans they create  will try to kill them and number two  they have no control over which aliens  will be turned into pure titans  what that second point means is that if  a regular alden uses the shifter  the screen will indiscriminately  titanize everyone in the area including  any ldn friends they have who might  happen to be nearby  this effect also can't be undone by the  past titan's first screen  as like i said that power doesn't work  after transformation is already complete  now on the other hand if the past titan  is held by someone of royal blood  they can select which people they don't  want to be transformed and any pure  titans they make will automatically  follow their instructions  other powers of this shifter include the  ability to summon one ld into the past  dimension  regardless of where that person might be  in the real world this telepathy  requires a bit of stamina it can  therefore only be used once a day  but it's still a great thing for  long-range communication because if you  think about it if someone had this  during the invasion of parodies  they would have been able to provide  updates to their fellow warriors back  home without anyone on the island  knowing a thing  on a separate note as many of you know  time passes a lot differently in the  past dimension  so what might feel like hours or even  days in there might only be equivalent  to a few seconds in reality  this not only means that the past titan  can have long conversations with someone  else  but in theory they could also use this  power to temporarily confuse their  enemies  as an example let's say mikasa was about  to attack the shifter but as she gets  closer her mind is sent to the past  dimension for what feels like hours  by the time she comes back to reality  she'll be heavily disorientated  and likely won't follow through with  what she was about to do in this way  this tactic could very effectively be  used to throw people off their game  but like i said it can only be used once  a day i should probably also mention  that despite being connected to every  eldian the past titan is not able to  manipulate memories in any way  but rather it's forced to see the  memories of every pure titan it touches  i consider this to be more of a curse  than a blessing as by making physical  contact the past titan has no choice but  to see flashes of what their life used  to be  there's nothing it can do to help them  besides that as it can't turn them back  into a human once they're already  transformed  so it's basically like being forced to  watch a really sad movie whenever it  happens to touch a minus titan  last point to mention before we  summarize all of its abilities is that  this shifter has a maximum of three  consecutive transformations  which is more than the colossal which  maxes out one but still the exact same  as the attack titan  anyway in summary the past titan has two  distinct screams  one that prevents the transformation of  other titans and another that creates  titans without the need for spinal fluid  injections  if the user doesn't have real blood then  doing that second scream is effectively  suicide but if they are royalty then  they can create their own personal titan  army that listens to their commands  once a day the shifter can also summon  one ld to the past dimension  which is useful for both confusing  opponents and for long-range  communication  sadly though the past titan cannot  access or manipulate memories but  instead is forced to see the past  memories of every pure titan it  physically touches  additionally skin is mostly covered in  thin hardening which gives it a constant  layer of protection  and in my opinion that has a great  chance against every shifter except  these two in a fight  as always guys thank you for watching  this video and let me know in the  comments how do you think the past item  would do in a 1v1 fight against the  other shifters  also don't forget to sub and until the  next one peace out

